  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNFPA SRHR/hiv ungd Alb</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNFPA SRHR/hiv youth Alb</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNFPA will contribute to anenabling the provision of quality SRHR information and youth-friendly health services by educating and training decision makers from key ministries (Min of Education), NGOs, school educators, health service personnel across the country as well as parents and the media. Curriculum in Healthy Lifestyles Education will be introduced in secondary schools.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNFPA-projektet ska utbilda h&#xe4;lsopersonal i ungdomsv&#xe4;nlig service i syfte att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra kvaliteten p&#xe5; den v&#xe5;rd och information som ungdomar kan f&#xe5; avs SRHR och hiv/aids. Utbildningsministeriet ska introducera H&#xe4;lsosamma livsstilar som concept i utbildningsplanen f&#xf6;r gymnasieskolor.Uttbildningen sker tillsammans med Ministry of Education.</narrative>
  </description>
